# Grid A — S5 Enumerate (sub-package entry points)
#
# Targets: generic + ShapeListOfSymbols + ReqEnumeration. Exercises
# the enumerator's ability to resolve a DIRECTORY into its children
# (structural traversal) rather than symbol-by-symbol keyword search.
#
# Ground truth (CLAUDE.md §Analysis sub-packages table): 14 sub-
# packages live under internal/analysis/ and each has a single
# entry-point function. Positive anchor picks 4 of the 14 canonical
# package names that every reasonable enumeration must contain. The
# gate intentionally is 4-of-14 (not all 14) so an answer phrased as
# "... and 10 others" can still pass, but any answer missing all four
# anchors is definitionally incomplete.
ID="s5b"
NAME="enumerate — internal/analysis sub-packages"
QUESTION="列出 internal/analysis/ 下所有子包的目录名，以及每个子包的单一入口函数（entry-point function）。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="normalizer compiler criterion gate"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=".java .py"
